   "body": "/claim cloud/m4q-reliab-opus\n\nPlan (one PR with #1192, they share `ContentLoader`):\n- Re-verified at `dev-swift` @ `fa96c1c1`: `ContentLoader.finish` still drops `.failure(.cancelled)` with no value/error; `FilteredPostsModel.read` turns `.network(.cancelled)` into `.success(nil)`; `QualityAlertsModel.load` returns with `hasLoaded` false.\n- `ContentLoader.load`: an unrequested `.cancelled` (task not cancelled, generation unchanged) is retried once, then shown as `.other` (the reader's #566 rule).\n- Same rule in `FilteredPostsModel.read` and `QualityAlertsModel.load` (`Task.isCancelled`/ticket check), second time → failure.\n- Tests first: `ContentLoaderTests.aCancellationNobodyAskedForIsRetriedOnce` (+ twice → error), `FilteredPostsModelTests.aCancellationNobodyAskedForIsAFailure`, `QualityAlertsModelTests.aCancellationNobodyAskedForEndsTheLoad`.\n- Fable adversarial review, draft PR with `compile-check`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
